{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484850/extras/734fc64e375fb70cb335522736198240.avif?t=1756219975\" data-has-big width=800 height=112 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484850/extras/a5d4a7547d35a14ca4c3d3f3bd039b36.poster.avif?t=1756219975\" width=730 height=410 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484850/extras/a5d4a7547d35a14ca4c3d3f3bd039b36.webm?t=1756219975\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484850/extras/a5d4a7547d35a14ca4c3d3f3bd039b36.mp4?t=1756219975\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Burdened with gambling debts and forced to leave your hometown, you arrive in a city powered by garbage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start by cleaning streets for spare cash\u2014but that won\u2019t be enough. To get ahead, you\u2019ll need to <strong>lie, steal, gamble, or scam</strong> your way to the top.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you've made your first fortune, <strong>build your scam empire</strong>\u2014set up a scam centre, post fake ads, and trick your victims.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484850/extras/ade80b1eb19a4a9499eb1e78e35ac8d1.poster.avif?t=1756219975\" width=778 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484850/extras/ade80b1eb19a4a9499eb1e78e35ac8d1.webm?t=1756219975\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484850/extras/ade80b1eb19a4a9499eb1e78e35ac8d1.mp4?t=1756219975\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Manage your workers</strong> and decide: treat them fairly, or squeeze them for every dollar.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this town, only the cunning survive.<br><strong>Will you rise\u2014or fall under your own schemes?</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3484850?t=1756219975","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484850/a4bfdbca897c67eda92c742aa1ad839e84a5b76d/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1756219975","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484850/04f310b3e5d7040d18c91b5d40f739970f297a7b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756219975","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484850/04f310b3e5d7040d18c91b5d40f739970f297a7b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756219975","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Violence on human characters."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484850/extras/734fc64e375fb70cb335522736198240.avif?t=1756219975\" data-has-big width=800 height=112 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484850/extras/a5d4a7547d35a14ca4c3d3f3bd039b36.poster.avif?t=1756219975\" width=730 height=410 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484850/extras/a5d4a7547d35a14ca4c3d3f3bd039b36.webm?t=1756219975\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.ste